#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:5 17519b0b230a49b2b421eee07d743414
msgid "Acro Mode"
msgstr "Acro 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:7 89cf23b2f3274684b4719a71e2de0fd2
msgid ""
"In Acro mode the user's steering stick controls the vehicle's turn rate and "
"the throttle stick controls the vehicle's speed."
msgstr "在 Acro 模式下，用户的转向摇杆控制车辆的转弯速率，油门摇杆控制车辆的速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:9 1f773ac4d83e4b46bceca72004b46006
msgid ""
"the :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` parameter controls the maximum "
"turn rate the user's steering stick can request. The turn rate varies "
"linearly from zero to :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` as the RC input"
" varies from neutral to full deflection. Once the input returns to neutral, "
"the vehicle will attempt to hold heading, compensating for external "
"influences, ie. \"heading hold\"."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` 参数控制用户转向摇杆所能请求的最大转弯速率。随着 RC "
"输入从中立位置变化到最大偏转，转弯速率从零线性变化至 :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE "
"<ACRO_TURN_RATE>`。一旦输入回到中立位置，车辆将尝试保持航向，补偿外部干扰，即「航向保持」。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:10 91a32cb840f84e0c9ede26f15c7dcd44
msgid ""
"the top speed is interpolated from the :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE "
"<CRUISE_THROTTLE>` and :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` parameters.  These"
" parameters are described on the :ref:`Tuning Speed and Throttle <rover-"
"tuning-throttle-and-speed>` page."
msgstr ""
"最高速度由 :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED "
"<CRUISE_SPEED>` 参数插值得出。这些参数在 :ref:`速度与油门调试 <rover-tuning-throttle-and-"
"speed>` 页面中有详细描述。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:11 b02d677aad7944e79531b7c5b5d6bbe8
msgid ""
":ref:`Object Avoidance <rover-object-avoidance>` is active in this mode (if "
"configured)."
msgstr "本模式下 :ref:`避障功能 <rover-object-avoidance>` 处于激活状态（如已配置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:13 41e02c7b0e914729aa070762ef610fec
msgid ""
"This mode is perhaps the most useful mode for tuning the vehicle's "
":ref:`Steering Rate <rover-tuning-steering-rate>` controller."
msgstr "本模式可能是调整车辆 :ref:`转向速率 <rover-tuning-steering-rate>` 控制器最为实用的模式。"
